SCOPE OF THIS LICENCE

This MIT licence covers the source code and documentation authored in this
repository. It does NOT relicense third-party data or models, which retain
their own terms:

  * OpenAQ station observations and their underlying Indian providers
    (CPCB, state pollution control boards) — see the provider's terms.
  * Copernicus CAMS and ERA5 — Copernicus licence; attribution required.
  * NOAA GFS — U.S. Government work, public domain.
  * SILAM (Finnish Meteorological Institute) — CC BY 4.0.
  * Microsoft Aurora model weights — see the Aurora repository's licence.

Derived tables in this repository inherit the terms of their upstream sources.
